# https://github.com/php/php-src/issues/11678 (php-src 577b8ae422, 8.2+): on musl the fopencookie() seeker takes off_t *
9026-GH-11678-musl-cookie-seeker.patch
# deb.sury.org fix carried by its php7.1 series but missing from php7.0 (same bundled libmagic in 7.0)
# (the other php7.1-only fixes do not apply here: bug #79091 needs the session id collision retry loop added in
